        "original_id": "5fecf64a-34ea-5c5c-9db9-164a6fa7596f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Hu Lanqi, Maxim Gorky\n- Places: Nazi Germany, Moscow\n- Works: Hu Lanqi's memoir\n- Honors: Nobel Prize in Literature nominations\n\nFacts:\n- In 1933, Hu Lanqi was imprisoned by Nazi Germany.\n- After her imprisonment, Hu Lanqi wrote an influential memoir about her experience.\n- Hu Lanqi's memoir led Maxim Gorky to invite Hu Lanqi to meet him in Moscow.\n- Maxim Gorky was nominated five times for the Nobel Prize in Literature.",
